  "doctrine": [],
  "note": "Hebrew š corresponds to ṯ in the Arabic, Sabaic and Mehri tree names. The Soqotri comparison identifies a tree but leaves its species unspecified. The burial account in 1Ch.10.12 uses a different Hebrew tree name, אֵלָה. None of the three occurrences of אֵשֶׁל distinguishes a particular species of tamarisk."
